OL,3,GNEWSATwo motorcyclists seriously hurt
OL,4,Ain head-on crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has been left with
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries and another
OL,8,Fhas been seriously hurt after their two
OL,9,Fbikes crashed.
OL,11,FA Blue Yamaha MT-03 motorcycle and a
OL,12,Fblack BMW S1000 were involved in a
OL,13,Fhead-on collision in Stanham Way, near
OL,14,FCardea, Peterborough, at about 17:20
OL,15,FBST on Monday.
OL,17,FThe rider of the Yamaha, a 19-year-old
OL,18,Fman from Peterborough, suffered
OL,19,Fserious, life-threatening injuries
OL,20,Fwhile the rider of the BMW, a man, 32,
OL,21,Ffrom London, sustained serious but not
OL,22,Flife-threatening injuries.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
